OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation to take place after
OL,4,Achurch blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FA joint police and fire investigation
OL,7,Fis set to take place after a blaze at a
OL,8,Fchurch in the village of Kilburn.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,11,Fit was called to the two-storey
OL,12,Fbuilding in Chapel Street at 00:24 BST
OL,13,Fon Friday. Six appliances and an aerial
OL,14,Fladder platform were sent to the scene.
OL,16,FResidents in neighbouring properties
OL,17,Fwere evacuated as a precaution and the
OL,18,Froad was closed while firefighters
OL,19,Fdealt with the blaze.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
