OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation to take place after
OL,4,Achurch blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews left the scene at 07:20, the
OL,7,Froad was reopened and residents were
OL,8,Fallowed to return home. However, in an
OL,9,Fupdate at 10:13, the fire service said
OL,10,Ffirefighters had returned to the scene
OL,11,Ffollowing reports of smoke coming from
OL,12,Fthe building.
